  <h2>Gaurav Srivastava</h2>
  <p class="lead">Gaurav Srivastava is a corporate IT professional who writes because the process helps him make sense of what he is living through.</p>
  <p><em>Nothing Gets to You</em> grew out of a simple, stubborn problem: winning arguments and losing evenings, replaying a five-second exchange for a week, handing his peace to whoever happened to push the right button. This book is what he found on the way to a steadier way of living, written in plain language, with honest examples and small moves you can actually make.</p>
